WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:13.169
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:13.439 --> 01:14.519
Miss, where's my bag?

3
01:14.879 --> 01:15.719
I didn't notice.

4
01:15.920 --> 01:16.920
I left it right here.

5
02:55.840 --> 02:56.879
The next morning,

6
02:57.319 --> 02:58.319
I went to the scene.

7
02:59.439 --> 03:01.039
I took a photo of this under the bench.

8
03:02.400 --> 03:04.039
This glove has "Sheng" stitched on it.

9
03:05.240 --> 03:06.719
Your mother knitted this for you, right?

10
03:09.680 --> 03:10.560
So what if she did?

11
03:14.280 --> 03:15.280
I want to know

12
03:15.599 --> 03:16.560
why on that night,

13
03:17.120 --> 03:18.919
you two didn't go home together.

14
03:20.520 --> 03:21.599
What does that have to do with you?

15
03:22.159 --> 03:22.800
She was her,

16
03:22.960 --> 03:23.639
and I was me.

17
03:24.000 --> 03:25.400
Why did we have to go home together?

18
03:25.840 --> 03:27.199
If you'd gone home together,

19
03:27.719 --> 03:28.840
she wouldn't have frozen to death.

20
03:32.400 --> 03:33.120
I know that

21
03:33.360 --> 03:34.120
as a Beer Taster,

22
03:34.120 --> 03:35.000
she never drank.

23
03:35.840 --> 03:37.400
So why did she drink so much that night?

24
03:37.719 --> 03:38.680
Who was she drinking with?

25
03:40.080 --> 03:41.280
I want to find out the truth.

26
03:43.520 --> 03:44.039
The truth?

27
03:44.879 --> 03:46.080
Didn't you ask me here

28
03:46.199 --> 03:47.240
to tell me the truth?

29
03:47.680 --> 03:48.840
What truth would I tell you?

30
03:49.400 --> 03:50.560
Didn't you ask me here?

31
03:52.599 --> 03:53.879
Didn't you write this note to me?

32
04:00.719 --> 04:01.639
That's not my handwriting.

33
04:04.120 --> 04:04.639
Something's wrong.

34
04:04.639 --> 04:05.120
Let's get out of here.

35
04:06.759 --> 04:07.599
Nobody move!

36
04:11.039 --> 04:12.280
I called you both here today

37
04:12.680 --> 04:14.439
to find out the truth.

38
04:15.240 --> 04:16.120
If we don't figure it out,

39
04:16.759 --> 04:18.199
neither of you is leaving here alive!

40
04:25.079 --> 04:25.800
Liu Xiaosheng,

41
04:26.600 --> 04:27.759
how the hell did your mom die?

42
04:28.160 --> 04:29.519
You were right there at the time.

43
04:29.800 --> 04:31.040
How could she still freeze to death?

44
04:32.040 --> 04:32.959
What do you know?

45
04:33.720 --> 04:34.759
You didn't know her at all!

46
04:36.279 --> 04:37.120
I didn't know her?

47
04:38.199 --> 04:39.040
Your mom and my master

48
04:39.040 --> 04:40.399
were the best people in the world.

49
04:41.040 --> 04:41.959
How could I not know her?

50
04:43.600 --> 04:44.319
You knew her?

51
04:44.839 --> 04:45.800
Ever heard of Chen Yuan?

52
04:46.319 --> 04:47.000
Chen Yuan?

53
04:48.680 --> 04:49.639
Who's Chen Yuan?

54
04:50.839 --> 04:52.079
You don't even know Chen Yuan,

55
04:52.439 --> 04:53.839
yet you think you knew her?

56
04:55.000 --> 04:55.959
Chen Yuan was a teacher.

57
04:56.600 --> 04:57.959
Every vacation, he'd come tutor me.

58
04:58.680 --> 04:59.920
He said he was tutoring me,

59
05:00.439 --> 05:01.800
but he was really after my mom.

60
05:05.360 --> 05:06.040
Stop talking!

61
05:06.399 --> 05:07.160
Stay out of this!

62
05:07.759 --> 05:09.000
I've never told this to anyone.

63
05:09.399 --> 05:10.720
I planned to take it to my grave.

64
05:11.399 --> 05:12.720
Since things have come to this,

65
05:13.160 --> 05:14.800
and who knows if I'll live past today,

66
05:15.279 --> 05:16.519
I don't care anymore.

67
05:18.000 --> 05:19.279
Tell me the truth, kid!

68
05:20.120 --> 05:21.319
What really happened with Chen Yuan?

69
05:22.000 --> 05:23.000
Did he hurt you two?

70
05:23.199 --> 05:24.040
It's because of him

71
05:24.439 --> 05:25.319
that my mom died!

72
05:25.759 --> 05:26.600
If it weren't for him,

73
05:27.000 --> 05:28.399
she would never have frozen to death!

74
05:32.199 --> 05:33.199
Where does Chen live?

75
05:33.560 --> 05:34.160
I don't know!

76
05:34.560 --> 05:35.160
Speak!

77
05:35.519 --> 05:36.360
I don't know!

78
05:38.639 --> 05:39.680
Tieping, calm down!

79
05:40.120 --> 05:41.759
I've kept this buried inside for over ten years.

80
05:42.720 --> 05:43.319
I kept quiet

81
05:43.920 --> 05:44.920
not for Chen Yuan's sake,

82
05:45.680 --> 05:47.360
but so people wouldn't badmouth my mom!

83
05:48.319 --> 05:49.360
She's already dead!

84
05:49.879 --> 05:50.959
She can't speak for herself!

85
05:51.680 --> 05:53.040
You all came demanding the truth from me!

86
05:53.759 --> 05:54.399
Fine!

87
05:55.040 --> 05:56.519
I'll tell you what the truth is!

88
05:58.240 --> 05:59.439
Write carefully now.

89
06:02.000 --> 06:04.040
What's the line after "Plunging three thousand feet"?

90
06:06.879 --> 06:07.519
I don't know.

91
06:08.120 --> 06:08.800
You don't know?

92
06:09.279 --> 06:10.600
Didn't we just recite it?

93
06:10.920 --> 06:12.160
How did you forget already?

94
06:13.920 --> 06:15.279
Thank you for your hard work, Mr. Chen.

95
06:15.519 --> 06:16.639
You've been talking all morning.

96
06:16.759 --> 06:17.519
Have some fruit.

97
06:18.519 --> 06:20.199
Good job to you too, Xiaosheng.

98
06:20.399 --> 06:21.160
You should have some fruit too.

99
06:21.759 --> 06:22.759
Thank you, Sister Xuemei.

100
06:23.600 --> 06:24.160
You're welcome.

101
06:33.759 --> 06:34.439
Let me see.

102
06:34.439 --> 06:35.519
What did you write?

103
06:37.000 --> 06:38.519
Xiaosheng wrote all of this.

104
06:39.199 --> 06:40.120
Yeah.

105
06:40.240 --> 06:41.759
He's been writing all morning.

106
06:42.160 --> 06:43.399
Really put his heart into it.

107
06:44.639 --> 06:45.360
Great job.

108
06:45.839 --> 06:46.879
I'm making dumplings today,

109
06:47.079 --> 06:48.240
a nice treat for both of you.

110
06:48.639 --> 06:49.639
Dumplings are my favorite!

111
06:53.639 --> 06:55.160
Why did you lie to my mom?

112
06:56.240 --> 06:56.879
If I told the truth,

113
06:56.879 --> 06:57.639
wouldn't she chew you out?

114
06:58.399 --> 06:59.519
Mind your own business.

115
07:00.160 --> 07:00.560
You...

116
07:05.000 --> 07:05.879
That dress...

117
07:06.240 --> 07:06.879
You bought it.

118
07:08.079 --> 07:09.600
She wears it every time you come over,

119
07:09.920 --> 07:11.000
acting all vain.

120
07:11.519 --> 07:12.600
What do you mean, "vain"?

121
07:12.800 --> 07:13.680
She looks pretty.

122
07:13.879 --> 07:15.160
If she looks pretty, she deserves compliments.

123
07:15.360 --> 07:16.879
You don't need to buy her clothes anymore.

124
07:17.120 --> 07:17.720
I will.

125
07:18.360 --> 07:19.279
How old are you anyway?

126
07:19.839 --> 07:20.600
Where'll you get the money?

127
07:20.879 --> 07:22.040
Someday I'll make money.

128
07:22.519 --> 07:24.160
And I'll buy her the best clothes.

129
07:24.879 --> 07:25.639
That's the spirit.

130
07:26.600 --> 07:27.839
I never even thought about

131
07:28.240 --> 07:29.360
buying clothes for my mom.

132
07:31.000 --> 07:32.199
Too bad she's gone now.

133
07:41.199 --> 07:41.839
And another thing.

134
07:42.759 --> 07:44.079
Don't draw my mom anymore.

135
07:45.040 --> 07:46.639
I don't like her on bottle caps,

136
07:46.839 --> 07:47.519
scattered all over the ground.

137
07:47.680 --> 07:48.279
All right.

138
07:49.439 --> 07:50.920
Then this is a one-of-a-kind.

139
07:51.160 --> 07:52.040
What's a one-of-a-kind?

140
07:52.680 --> 07:53.519
A one-of-a-kind?

141
07:53.759 --> 07:55.839
It means there'll never be another one.

142
07:57.519 --> 07:58.600
You'll understand when you're older.

143
08:20.720 --> 08:21.399
Mom.

144
08:25.759 --> 08:26.279
Mom?

145
08:26.600 --> 08:27.040
Mom!

146
08:28.639 --> 08:29.040
Mom...

147
08:29.240 --> 08:30.199
You've been drinking?

148
08:30.519 --> 08:31.759
How did you get so drunk?

149
08:32.440 --> 08:33.879
I thought you couldn't drink.

150
08:34.120 --> 08:35.840
Who got you this wasted?

151
08:36.320 --> 08:37.000
Xiaosheng.

152
08:37.960 --> 08:38.799
It's so cold out.

153
08:38.919 --> 08:39.799
Why did you come out?

154
08:40.159 --> 08:41.120
Hurry on home.

155
08:42.759 --> 08:44.039
You left your pager at home.

156
08:44.440 --> 08:45.360
It kept going off.

157
08:45.600 --> 08:46.639
A lot of people are looking for you.

158
08:46.679 --> 08:48.039
I know what it's about.

159
08:48.320 --> 08:49.679
You didn't have to come all this way.

160
08:50.000 --> 08:50.720
Hurry back home.

161
08:50.840 --> 08:51.360
It's too cold out.

162
08:52.960 --> 08:54.320
Then what are you doing here?

163
08:56.519 --> 08:57.440
I'm making a call.

164
08:57.759 --> 08:59.519
You're calling Chen Yuan again?

165
09:03.399 --> 09:04.639
Xiaosheng...

166
09:05.360 --> 09:07.200
Isn't it almost New Year's?

167
09:07.639 --> 09:09.519
I made plans with Mr. Chen

168
09:09.559 --> 09:10.399
to ring in the new year together,

169
09:10.639 --> 09:11.639
and count down together.

170
09:11.799 --> 09:15.120
Five, four, three, two, one...

171
09:15.159 --> 09:16.279
Happy New Year!

172
09:17.320 --> 09:19.679
Happy New Year, Xiaosheng.

173
09:20.759 --> 09:21.960
Come on.

174
09:22.320 --> 09:24.200
Don't be mad.

175
09:24.200 --> 09:25.759
It's such a happy occasion.

176
09:26.360 --> 09:27.559
I've made up my mind.

177
09:27.799 --> 09:30.919
We'll live with Uncle Chen from now on.

178
09:31.240 --> 09:33.639
The three of us can build a good life.

179
09:34.000 --> 09:34.639
Okay?

180
09:35.320 --> 09:36.080
No!

181
09:37.039 --> 09:38.279
If you want to live with him, do it yourself!

182
09:38.559 --> 09:39.559
I'm not living with him!

183
09:41.679 --> 09:42.799
My sweet boy...

184
09:43.360 --> 09:45.159
You're my one and only baby.

185
09:46.399 --> 09:48.080
You'll understand when you grow up.

186
09:49.919 --> 09:50.679
In this life,

187
09:50.799 --> 09:52.279
everyone needs a home.

188
09:52.720 --> 09:53.879
Someone to help you,

189
09:54.639 --> 09:56.320
someone to have your back and cheer you on.

190
09:56.799 --> 09:58.559
I can have your back and cheer you on!

191
09:59.240 --> 10:00.120
We don't need him!

192
10:14.200 --> 10:16.159
Our Xiaosheng has really grown up.

193
10:16.559 --> 10:17.960
You can protect Mom now.

194
10:18.200 --> 10:19.320
Mom's so happy.

195
10:21.519 --> 10:23.000
But Mom also wants to give Xiaosheng

196
10:23.000 --> 10:24.360
a complete home.

197
10:25.799 --> 10:27.279
A real, proper home.

198
10:27.879 --> 10:29.679
Then no one can ever bully us again.

199
10:36.039 --> 10:37.159
Look how cold my boy is.

200
10:37.960 --> 10:39.320
Your little hands are freezing.

201
10:40.879 --> 10:41.200
Quick.

202
10:41.360 --> 10:42.240
Put on your mittens.

203
10:44.440 --> 10:46.759
Mom just knitted these mittens for you.

204
10:46.759 --> 10:48.080
Your name is on them.

205
10:48.360 --> 10:48.919
"Sheng."

206
10:49.360 --> 10:49.960
Do you like them?

207
10:50.200 --> 10:51.320
Come on, hurry up.

208
10:51.600 --> 10:52.000
Here.

209
10:52.919 --> 10:53.919
Don't catch a cold.

210
10:53.919 --> 10:55.080
Put them on, be a good boy.

211
10:55.639 --> 10:56.559
Be good, Xiaosheng.

212
10:59.679 --> 11:00.440
Hurry and put them on.

213
11:00.759 --> 11:01.440
Head home first.

214
11:01.679 --> 11:03.399
Mom will be home right after this call.

215
11:03.759 --> 11:04.399
Hurry home now.

216
11:04.639 --> 11:05.320
Mom...

217
11:05.440 --> 11:06.399
Go on, head home.

218
11:07.879 --> 11:09.120
Hello, Yuan?

219
11:13.320 --> 11:14.799
Sorry, you have the wrong number.

220
11:14.960 --> 11:15.919
This is a payphone.

221
11:45.759 --> 11:46.399
Hello.

222
11:46.399 --> 11:47.200
I'm looking for Chen Yuan.

223
11:52.200 --> 11:53.840
Let me leave a phone number then.

224
11:54.759 --> 11:55.759
0410.

225
11:56.519 --> 11:58.240
7801495.

226
11:59.240 --> 11:59.799
Thank you.

227
12:10.960 --> 12:12.080
I was furious that night.

228
12:12.840 --> 12:14.039
Thinking about how, just to see Chen Yuan,

229
12:14.360 --> 12:15.799
she was in such a rush to kick me out.

230
12:17.200 --> 12:18.759
What a loose woman.

231
12:23.440 --> 12:24.440
That's your mother!

232
12:24.840 --> 12:26.519
Badmouth her again, I dare you!

233
12:26.759 --> 12:27.279
Tieping!

234
12:27.399 --> 12:28.159
Calm down!

235
12:30.399 --> 12:31.200
And you!

236
12:31.440 --> 12:33.120
You're no good either!

237
12:33.840 --> 12:35.759
Where's the money Sister Xuemei got from Ma Guowen?

238
12:36.519 --> 12:37.159
Where is it?

239
12:38.159 --> 12:39.200
What money?

240
12:39.559 --> 12:40.240
The money!

241
12:41.679 --> 12:42.360
Playing dumb, huh?

242
12:47.759 --> 12:48.519
What's this?

243
12:49.360 --> 12:50.000
Liu Xuemei's bag!

244
12:50.000 --> 12:50.639
My mom's bag?

245
12:51.639 --> 12:52.600
Why do you have it?

246
12:53.320 --> 12:53.879
That's right.

247
12:54.320 --> 12:55.279
This is my mom's bag.

248
12:55.759 --> 12:56.799
There's a buttonhole here.

249
12:57.039 --> 12:58.399
She sewed a teddy bear over it.

250
12:59.200 --> 13:00.320
If I hadn't bumped into your mom

251
13:00.320 --> 13:01.759
carrying this bag to the market,

252
13:02.159 --> 13:03.840
I wouldn't have guessed you stole the money!

253
13:04.360 --> 13:05.039
My mom?

254
13:05.879 --> 13:07.639
How... How could the bag be with my mom?

255
13:07.840 --> 13:09.879
What money? What money are you talking about?

256
13:10.320 --> 13:11.000
No, no, no... I—

257
13:11.000 --> 13:11.799
"I didn't!" Still trying to deny it?

258
13:11.960 --> 13:12.879
You liar!

259
13:13.200 --> 13:13.960
I used to think

260
13:13.960 --> 13:15.519
Ma Guowen was the vile one,

261
13:17.200 --> 13:18.360
never thought you'd be one too!

262
13:18.639 --> 13:19.759
Turns out you're his accomplice!

263
13:21.080 --> 13:21.720
Tieping!

264
13:22.039 --> 13:23.279
Tieping, there's a misunderstanding here!

265
13:23.639 --> 13:24.360
I— Shut up!

266
13:25.159 --> 13:25.919
All these years,

267
13:26.360 --> 13:27.960
Sister Xuemei was falsely accused every single day,

268
13:28.519 --> 13:29.639
cursed out by name!

269
13:30.159 --> 13:31.559
Turns out you took the money,

270
13:32.440 --> 13:33.080
No!

271
13:33.279 --> 13:35.559
leaving her to live in disgrace for over a decade!

272
13:35.559 --> 13:36.519
I really have no idea what you're talking about!

273
13:36.519 --> 13:37.799
You were out living carefree,

274
13:38.519 --> 13:39.759
and came back acting like a good person!

275
13:42.080 --> 13:44.039
You're cut from the same cloth as Ma Guowen!

276
13:44.159 --> 13:45.360
I really didn't take that money!

277
13:45.559 --> 13:46.159
You deserve to die!

278
13:47.000 --> 13:47.600
Xiaosheng!

279
13:47.799 --> 13:48.399
Run!

280
13:49.000 --> 13:49.559
Run!

281
14:08.639 --> 14:09.320
Stop!

282
14:13.879 --> 14:14.600
Xiaosheng!

283
14:24.399 --> 14:24.799
Hello?

284
14:25.080 --> 14:25.720
I want to report a crime.

285
15:15.519 --> 15:16.120
Tieping.

286
15:17.360 --> 15:19.399
Why couldn't you just listen to your master?

287
15:39.519 --> 15:40.200
Holy shit!

288
15:41.679 --> 15:42.879
What the hell are you doing?

289
15:43.799 --> 15:45.039
You scared the hell out of me!

290
15:45.159 --> 15:46.320
Cheng Youtian, what are you doing?

291
15:48.200 --> 15:49.440
Haven't seen you in years.

292
15:50.759 --> 15:51.240
Look at you...

293
15:51.440 --> 15:52.159
It's freezing today.

294
15:52.159 --> 15:53.360
Coming in the dead of night like this...

295
15:53.559 --> 15:54.639
Couldn't you have called?

296
15:54.639 --> 15:55.840
Did you really have to come in person?

297
15:55.840 --> 15:56.440
In this freezing cold?

298
15:56.519 --> 15:56.960
What is it?

299
15:57.159 --> 15:58.360
I figured you wouldn't pick up.

300
16:00.039 --> 16:00.960
Well, go ahead then.

301
16:01.159 --> 16:01.840
What's so important...

302
16:01.840 --> 16:02.559
...that you had to say it to my face?

303
16:02.600 --> 16:03.039
Speak up.

304
16:03.639 --> 16:04.320
What's the matter?

305
16:05.039 --> 16:05.879
I heard...

306
16:06.799 --> 16:07.840
...you're selling the factory again?

307
16:09.799 --> 16:10.639
Cheng Youtian.

308
16:11.039 --> 16:12.919
Whether I sell it or not, what's it to you?

309
16:13.840 --> 16:15.759
Once the factory isn't yours anymore,

310
16:16.559 --> 16:17.960
what you owe everyone...

311
16:19.080 --> 16:20.360
can that finally be settled?

312
16:21.279 --> 16:22.720
Did I hear that right?

313
16:23.600 --> 16:25.159
What do I have unsettled with anyone?

314
16:25.759 --> 16:26.559
Name names.

315
16:26.960 --> 16:27.360
Who?

316
16:27.440 --> 16:28.320
Who is "everyone"?

317
16:29.679 --> 16:32.159
The money everyone pooled to buy the factory back then.

318
16:32.559 --> 16:33.559
Some folks...

319
16:33.840 --> 16:34.960
...feared your retaliation...

320
16:35.440 --> 16:36.399
...so they didn't dare take it back.

321
16:37.240 --> 16:38.279
When they came to you later,

322
16:38.519 --> 16:39.519
you never resolved it either.

323
16:40.120 --> 16:41.200
Now that the factory is being sold,

324
16:42.399 --> 16:43.759
I'm here on behalf of everyone...

325
16:45.159 --> 16:46.240
...to talk sense into you.

326
16:48.360 --> 16:50.080
You have the nerve to bring up the past?

327
16:51.039 --> 16:51.720
What about it?

328
16:51.720 --> 16:52.200
Back then,

329
16:52.200 --> 16:53.799
you all teamed up to go against me.

330
16:53.799 --> 16:54.639
You couldn't beat me.

331
16:54.840 --> 16:56.039
Now that life's been rough,

332
16:56.879 --> 16:57.720
you want to shake me down?

333
16:59.279 --> 17:00.360
How much are you trying to extort?

334
17:00.399 --> 17:00.960
Speak.

335
17:01.759 --> 17:02.600
Ma Guowen.

336
17:04.079 --> 17:05.279
Ask your conscience.

337
17:06.039 --> 17:07.119
As the factory director,

338
17:08.079 --> 17:09.440
how have you treated us veterans?

339
17:09.799 --> 17:10.759
How have you treated the workers?

340
17:11.960 --> 17:12.720
Once the factory is sold,

341
17:13.200 --> 17:15.119
you'll instantly become a multimillionaire.

342
17:15.680 --> 17:17.920
What about those who gave their lives for it?

343
17:18.759 --> 17:19.759
What do they get?

344
17:21.279 --> 17:22.279
The reason I came today...

345
17:22.599 --> 17:23.759
...is to give you a chance.

346
17:24.759 --> 17:25.799
So people won't...

347
17:25.799 --> 17:27.640
...spit on your name behind your back.

348
17:30.640 --> 17:31.519
Let them spit!

349
17:31.839 --> 17:32.960
Whoever wants to spit can go right ahead!

350
17:33.279 --> 17:33.799
What?

351
17:33.839 --> 17:34.640
Do you think I, Ma Guowen,

352
17:34.640 --> 17:36.160
am going to drown in people's spit?

353
17:36.680 --> 17:38.240
Do you people have any conscience?

354
17:38.920 --> 17:41.039
Didn't you get the New Year money I gave you?

355
17:41.319 --> 17:42.400
250 yuan!

356
17:43.119 --> 17:45.160
You gave each person 250 yuan for New Year?

357
17:45.799 --> 17:46.880
You were insulting us!

358
17:47.279 --> 17:48.440
What, is 250 not money?

359
17:48.440 --> 17:49.279
Can't you spend it?

360
17:49.440 --> 17:50.519
What you owe everyone...

361
17:50.559 --> 17:51.640
...is at least 200,000!

362
17:51.920 --> 17:52.440
Holy crap.

363
17:52.519 --> 17:53.039
200,000?

364
17:53.119 --> 17:54.359
Why not say two million?

365
17:54.720 --> 17:55.559
If you really want it,

366
17:55.680 --> 17:57.400
go ask the dead woman for it.

367
17:57.519 --> 17:58.079
Liu Xuemei.

368
17:58.240 --> 17:59.160
I gave the money to her.

369
17:59.160 --> 17:59.799
Go ask her!

370
18:01.079 --> 18:01.720
What did you say?

371
18:06.839 --> 18:07.599
That's impossible.

372
18:08.240 --> 18:08.880
Don't believe me?

373
18:09.839 --> 18:11.160
I'll show you the real proof.

374
18:20.319 --> 18:21.559
Seeing is believing.

375
18:22.720 --> 18:24.119
I wouldn't show this to just anyone.

376
18:36.839 --> 18:37.599
Come here, come on.

377
18:37.720 --> 18:38.319
Look at this. Take a look.

378
18:39.200 --> 18:39.960
See for yourself!

379
18:45.440 --> 18:46.000
Come on in, come on.

380
18:46.160 --> 18:46.599
Come on, come on.

381
18:46.680 --> 18:47.039
Have a seat.

382
18:48.680 --> 18:49.880
We still have some time

383
18:49.880 --> 18:50.519
before the auction starts.

384
18:50.640 --> 18:51.160
Let's have a chat.

385
18:51.160 --> 18:51.680
Come on, come over.

386
18:51.759 --> 18:52.279
Sit, sit down.

387
18:54.920 --> 18:55.839
Look at today...

388
18:56.400 --> 18:57.319
Don't just stand there.

389
18:57.359 --> 18:58.160
Come on, sit down and talk.

390
18:59.359 --> 19:00.519
On such a great day...

391
19:00.960 --> 19:01.880
Where did you come from?

392
19:04.000 --> 19:05.359
Whatever it is, sit down and tell me.

393
19:05.599 --> 19:06.960
On such a wonderful day,

394
19:06.960 --> 19:08.200
don't pull such a long face.

395
19:08.839 --> 19:09.960
Since you're here, let's have a drink.

396
19:10.079 --> 19:11.200
I've got all kinds of good liquor.

397
19:12.319 --> 19:12.960
Director Ma.

398
19:13.440 --> 19:14.160
You know this.

399
19:14.160 --> 19:15.039
I'm a Beer Taster.

400
19:15.240 --> 19:16.039
I'm not allowed to drink.

401
19:16.960 --> 19:17.640
Alright, alright.

402
19:17.640 --> 19:18.160
No drinking then.

403
19:20.559 --> 19:21.920
You came all by yourself.

404
19:22.119 --> 19:23.240
Leaving your kid at home,

405
19:23.559 --> 19:24.160
are you...

406
19:24.359 --> 19:25.079
really not worried?

407
19:26.759 --> 19:27.720
My son is well-behaved.

408
19:27.960 --> 19:28.559
He doesn't give me any trouble.

409
19:31.519 --> 19:33.160
Then I won't beat around the bush.

410
19:33.720 --> 19:34.960
What are you all really planning?

411
19:36.440 --> 19:37.319
Just the auction.

412
19:37.720 --> 19:38.400
Fair competition.

413
19:39.839 --> 19:40.640
Fair competition.

414
19:41.119 --> 19:42.400
Then where did your money come from?

415
19:43.559 --> 19:45.000
Those with money chipped in, those with strength helped out.

416
19:45.319 --> 19:46.000
We pooled it together.

417
19:47.720 --> 19:48.440
Oh, boy.

418
19:48.440 --> 19:49.799
Quite the united front.

419
19:50.640 --> 19:51.519
Looking at you,

420
19:51.960 --> 19:53.119
you don't look like the ringleader.

421
19:53.799 --> 19:54.599
Who sent you?

422
19:55.680 --> 19:56.359
I volunteered.

423
20:01.720 --> 20:03.359
That guy Qian sent you, didn't he?

424
20:06.759 --> 20:07.880
Or was it Cheng Youtian?

425
20:08.920 --> 20:10.720
Don't tell me it was Chief Engineer Chen?

426
20:12.519 --> 20:13.960
Don't think I don't know what's going on.

427
20:14.200 --> 20:15.079
Weren't all of you

428
20:15.400 --> 20:16.920
down in the workshop basement,

429
20:16.920 --> 20:18.440
hashing this out together?

430
20:18.440 --> 20:19.440
Quite the big show you put on.

431
20:19.680 --> 20:20.440
Even reporters showed up,

432
20:20.559 --> 20:21.119
didn't they?

433
20:21.880 --> 20:23.119
Did I leave anyone out?

434
20:23.960 --> 20:26.119
Little Tu, the cashier, was there too, right?

435
20:27.920 --> 20:29.319
I just don't get it.

436
20:29.319 --> 20:30.319
All of you people,

437
20:30.720 --> 20:32.920
why do you insist on crossing me?

438
20:34.359 --> 20:35.319
If you sell off the factory,

439
20:35.640 --> 20:36.400
what happens to thousands of workers

440
20:36.559 --> 20:37.759
and their families?

441
20:39.440 --> 20:41.839
That's a new business strategy!

442
20:42.519 --> 20:44.039
You think being a boss is easy?

443
20:45.559 --> 20:46.720
You have to study national policies,

444
20:46.720 --> 20:47.240
you know?

445
20:47.680 --> 20:48.519
Besides, selling the factory,

446
20:48.960 --> 20:50.559
is that something I can decide all on my own?

447
20:51.240 --> 20:52.400
If we can't even have a say

448
20:52.400 --> 20:53.240
in our own livelihoods...

449
20:56.920 --> 20:57.720
Don't get so worked up.

450
20:57.720 --> 20:58.559
Don't talk to me about

451
20:58.680 --> 21:00.359
how you'll run this factory in the future,

452
21:00.680 --> 21:02.119
or what I'd get by siding with you.

453
21:02.119 --> 21:02.839
Save your breath.

454
21:02.839 --> 21:03.799
I don't trust you at all.

455
21:04.720 --> 21:05.759
Even though I haven't been

456
21:06.000 --> 21:06.759
at our brewery for long,

457
21:07.039 --> 21:08.279
whether Lapi Brewery has gone sour,

458
21:08.279 --> 21:09.400
I was the first to taste it.

459
21:09.720 --> 21:11.599
I don't have the chops to do great things,

460
21:11.960 --> 21:13.799
but what's rightfully mine, what I want,

461
21:13.960 --> 21:15.880
what's within my reach,

462
21:15.880 --> 21:16.640
I have to fight for it.

463
21:17.400 --> 21:18.200
I have a son.

464
21:18.640 --> 21:19.799
And I have the rest of my life—

465
21:19.799 --> 21:21.079
decades ahead of me.

466
21:21.799 --> 21:22.759
I want to live well,

467
21:23.200 --> 21:23.880
and live peacefully.

468
21:27.079 --> 21:27.759
Let's end it here.

469
21:28.279 --> 21:29.319
The auction is about to start.

470
21:30.359 --> 21:31.079
Don't go. Don't go.

471
21:31.640 --> 21:33.039
I prepared something special just for you.

472
21:33.799 --> 21:34.759
No rush, give it just a minute.

473
21:34.839 --> 21:35.440
What do you think?

474
21:35.720 --> 21:36.200
Let go.

475
21:36.200 --> 21:36.920
Fine, fine, fine.

476
21:40.519 --> 21:41.200
Well, today,

477
21:41.200 --> 21:42.880
forget about attending the auction.

478
21:42.880 --> 21:44.519
I'm not letting you walk out of this room.

479
21:49.359 --> 21:51.359
You people aren't buying this brewery.

480
21:51.359 --> 21:52.680
If you're smart,

481
21:52.680 --> 21:53.960
take the money and walk away.

482
21:58.000 --> 21:58.680
It's yours.

483
22:08.039 --> 22:09.240
This is your idea of sincerity.

484
22:21.279 --> 22:22.799
Holy shit.

485
22:24.400 --> 22:26.759
You're really asking for a lot.

486
22:36.039 --> 22:37.359
There's gotta be more than this in the bag.

487
22:41.799 --> 22:42.720
Quite a lot, actually.

488
22:43.079 --> 22:44.160
Exactly 200,000.

489
22:46.039 --> 22:47.039
How much do you want?

490
22:47.960 --> 22:49.759
How much you get depends on what you can do.

491
22:50.599 --> 22:51.640
I want all of it.

492
22:54.079 --> 22:54.920
Holy shit.

493
22:59.799 --> 23:01.079
Holy shit.

494
23:02.680 --> 23:04.319
Got quite an appetite, don't you?

495
23:09.559 --> 23:10.319
Tell you what.

496
23:11.240 --> 23:12.440
This is some good liquor.

497
23:15.720 --> 23:16.279
One glass,

498
23:16.920 --> 23:17.359
10,000.

499
23:19.640 --> 23:20.359
However much you drink,

500
23:20.920 --> 23:21.720
is how much you take.

501
23:35.519 --> 23:36.039
All right.

502
23:37.440 --> 23:38.440
You said it.

503
23:38.680 --> 23:39.559
I did.

504
24:14.319 --> 24:14.920
All right.

505
24:28.039 --> 24:28.559
Ten thousand.

506
24:28.839 --> 24:29.599
Again.

507
24:57.680 --> 24:58.599
Take the money. Take the money.

508
25:01.400 --> 25:02.559
Come on, come on.

509
25:02.559 --> 25:03.400
Keep drinking, keep drinking.

510
25:03.680 --> 25:04.599
There's plenty...

511
25:04.920 --> 25:05.559
of booze.

512
25:05.720 --> 25:06.880
And plenty of cash, too.

513
25:07.799 --> 25:09.440
Let's see how much you can drink.

514
25:18.640 --> 25:19.519
Come on, drink up.

515
25:19.519 --> 25:20.160
Come, sit down and drink.

516
25:20.160 --> 25:20.640
Sit down and drink.

517
25:20.640 --> 25:21.640
Come on, come on.

518
25:21.680 --> 25:22.279
Easy, take it easy.

519
25:22.799 --> 25:23.519
No rush.

520
25:24.640 --> 25:26.640
There's... there's plenty of cash.

521
25:26.799 --> 25:27.240
And booze...

522
25:28.240 --> 25:28.720
What's wrong?

523
25:29.240 --> 25:30.559
Touching costs extra.

524
25:31.119 --> 25:32.000
How much extra?

525
25:32.400 --> 25:33.359
10,000 for a touch.

526
25:34.519 --> 25:35.720
What... What about a kiss?

527
25:35.720 --> 25:36.359
20,000.

528
25:40.720 --> 25:41.680
Alright, alright, alright.

529
25:42.039 --> 25:42.519
Come here, come on.

530
25:42.519 --> 25:42.880
I'll give you...

531
25:42.920 --> 25:43.759
I'll add more for you.

532
25:46.240 --> 25:46.920
Come here, let me kiss you.

533
25:47.039 --> 25:47.519
Come here.

534
25:51.599 --> 25:52.759
You old bastard.

535
25:55.759 --> 25:56.640
With all your rotten deeds...

536
25:59.680 --> 26:00.400
I really want to...

537
26:01.079 --> 26:01.839
beat you to death.

538
26:01.880 --> 26:02.559
Don't, don't, don't.

539
26:02.680 --> 26:03.240
Calm down.

540
26:03.279 --> 26:04.839
I... I forgot about that.

541
26:05.039 --> 26:06.039
You used to chase this slut,

542
26:06.119 --> 26:06.559
didn't you?

543
26:06.799 --> 26:08.759
Any real man loved how slutty she was.

544
26:09.039 --> 26:10.079
I'm not kidding you.

545
26:10.079 --> 26:11.880
If I hadn't been in a rush for a meeting that day,

546
26:11.880 --> 26:13.160
I would've had my way with her.

547
26:13.759 --> 26:14.599
You bastard!

548
26:15.440 --> 26:16.039
Security!

549
26:16.799 --> 26:17.359
Cheng Youtian,

550
26:17.519 --> 26:19.240
you wanna get rough with me over that slut,

551
26:19.240 --> 26:19.759
is that it?

552
26:22.400 --> 26:25.079
Look at your frail, mushy body.

553
26:25.359 --> 26:26.039
You think you can take me on?

554
26:26.039 --> 26:26.640
Director Ma!

555
26:27.240 --> 26:27.839
Director Ma!

556
26:28.839 --> 26:30.400
Go back the way you came, nice and quiet.

557
26:30.440 --> 26:31.119
Did you hear me?

558
26:31.440 --> 26:32.599
Before security kicks...

559
26:32.599 --> 26:33.559
kicks you the hell out!

560
26:33.599 --> 26:34.200
Did you hear me?

561
26:34.359 --> 26:35.039
Get the fuck out!

562
26:35.400 --> 26:35.839
Get lost!

563
26:56.519 --> 26:56.960
It's getting cold.

564
26:56.960 --> 26:57.880
Don't catch a cold.

565
26:58.640 --> 26:59.240
Alright, alright.

566
27:01.240 --> 27:01.960
Oh, jeez!

567
27:13.880 --> 27:15.359
You little vixen.

568
27:21.759 --> 27:22.680
Alright, alright, alright.

569
27:29.279 --> 27:29.920
Slow down, slow down.

570
27:30.000 --> 27:30.599
No rush.

571
27:30.640 --> 27:31.319
Take your time.

572
27:31.359 --> 27:31.920
No need to rush.

573
27:32.680 --> 27:33.880
There's plenty of money.

574
27:33.880 --> 27:35.160
Plenty of booze, too.

575
27:35.319 --> 27:36.039
If you're happy,

576
27:36.039 --> 27:36.920
I'm happy.

577
27:40.240 --> 27:41.119
Come on, come on.

578
27:41.319 --> 27:43.319
Slowly, slowly, nice and slow.

579
27:49.960 --> 27:51.279
Got quite some strength, huh?

580
28:19.240 --> 28:19.799
Holy crap!

581
28:19.799 --> 28:20.279
All gone.

582
28:21.440 --> 28:22.160
No more money.

583
28:23.559 --> 28:24.359
I can still drink!

584
28:24.759 --> 28:25.720
We do! Plenty of it!

585
28:25.720 --> 28:26.079
Come on, come on.

586
28:26.079 --> 28:26.400
Money!

587
28:26.519 --> 28:27.000
Let's head this way.

588
28:27.000 --> 28:27.400
Come on.

589
28:27.440 --> 28:28.559
Plenty of money, plenty of booze!

590
28:28.599 --> 28:28.960
Come on, come on.

591
28:29.039 --> 28:29.720
This way, this way.

592
28:29.960 --> 28:30.400
Take the money.

593
28:30.400 --> 28:30.960
Come on, come on.

594
28:31.079 --> 28:31.559
Easy, easy, easy.

595
28:31.559 --> 28:32.200
Take it easy, slow down.

596
28:32.200 --> 28:32.759
Easy, easy.

597
28:32.759 --> 28:33.440
Steady now. Still got cash?

598
28:33.519 --> 28:34.279
Yeah, yeah, I do.

599
28:34.319 --> 28:34.720
Come on, come on.

600
28:34.759 --> 28:36.359
Sit down, have a seat.

601
28:38.039 --> 28:39.119
Got plenty of cash!

602
28:39.400 --> 28:40.119
Come on.

603
28:45.160 --> 28:45.599
Direct—

604
28:46.440 --> 28:47.200
Director!

605
28:47.799 --> 28:48.680
What the hell is it?

606
28:49.880 --> 28:51.119
The auction has started.

607
28:51.119 --> 28:51.920
Everyone's here?

608
28:52.759 --> 28:53.559
Everyone's arrived.

609
28:53.759 --> 28:54.640
Just waiting on you.

610
28:57.440 --> 28:57.960
Xuemei.

611
28:58.519 --> 29:00.400
Drink... drink some water.

612
29:00.839 --> 29:01.240
Have some water.

613
29:01.400 --> 29:01.880
Sober up a bit.

614
29:02.519 --> 29:03.720
I... I'll go to the meeting.

615
29:03.880 --> 29:04.839
I'll be back as soon as it's over.

616
29:04.880 --> 29:05.319
All right?

617
29:05.599 --> 29:06.279
Wait for me, okay?

618
29:07.519 --> 29:08.400
Holy crap...

619
29:11.880 --> 29:13.200
Terrible timing.

620
29:15.680 --> 29:16.400
Hey...

621
29:17.079 --> 29:17.720
Drink some water.

622
29:18.119 --> 29:18.559
Sober up, okay?

623
29:18.880 --> 29:20.079
I'll be right back.

624
29:25.640 --> 29:26.559
Quite something, huh?

625
31:52.799 --> 31:54.519
Even drunk, you still knew to grab the money, huh?

626
34:32.559 --> 34:33.760
Tieping.

627
34:36.320 --> 34:38.360
Why are you so foolish?

628
34:39.039 --> 34:40.400
Tieping.

629
36:16.679 --> 36:18.559
I know Master's been doing everything to protect me,

630
36:19.400 --> 36:20.599
but I can't let her go.

631
36:20.840 --> 36:22.119
She took Sister Xuemei's money.

632
36:22.440 --> 36:23.159
She's not a good person.

633
36:23.159 --> 36:23.599
Don't.

634
36:23.800 --> 36:25.559
Who's good and who's bad—

635
36:25.840 --> 36:27.840
what's that got to do with you?

636
36:29.559 --> 36:31.559
You can't go hurting people!

637
36:31.559 --> 36:33.599
What does this have to do with you?

638
36:35.519 --> 36:36.119
Tieping.

639
36:36.719 --> 36:37.360
Listen to me.

640
36:39.000 --> 36:39.840
I'm the one who killed them.

641
36:40.320 --> 36:41.159
I dumped the bodies.

642
36:42.079 --> 36:44.159
Up till now, you've only done one bad thing.

643
36:46.679 --> 36:47.960
You don't deserve to die for it.

644
36:49.239 --> 36:50.079
Do you hear me?

645
36:50.920 --> 36:51.920
Do you understand?

646
36:52.920 --> 36:54.599
We still have a long life ahead.

647
36:56.840 --> 36:57.360
Master.

648
37:00.360 --> 37:01.559
I killed them.

649
37:01.920 --> 37:02.920
I dumped the bodies.

650
37:03.360 --> 37:05.159
I'll take the fall for my own crimes.

651
37:05.280 --> 37:06.559
Tieping!

652
37:08.119 --> 37:09.039
Tieping!

653
37:14.639 --> 37:15.519
Shen Leshui.

654
37:16.159 --> 37:16.960
Liu Xiaosheng.

655
37:17.760 --> 37:18.920
Both of you bear witness for me.

656
37:19.800 --> 37:21.239
I killed Ma Guowen.

657
37:22.119 --> 37:23.039
I killed Ma Guowen...

658
37:23.039 --> 37:24.920
...because he dragged Sister Xuemei's name through the mud.

659
37:26.159 --> 37:27.840
I killed Qian Yichuan too.

660
37:28.960 --> 37:30.960
I killed him because of that foul mouth of his.

661
37:31.280 --> 37:32.360
The day Ma Guowen was killed,

662
37:32.679 --> 37:33.760
he was in the old plant area too.

663
37:33.880 --> 37:34.960
He saw me commit the murder,

664
37:35.320 --> 37:37.079
and used it to blackmail my master.

665
37:37.800 --> 37:38.800
If I hadn't killed him,

666
37:39.199 --> 37:40.280
none of us would've ever had peace.

667
37:40.400 --> 37:41.559
Tieping!

668
37:42.199 --> 37:44.119
It was me he saw!

669
37:46.119 --> 37:48.440
The clothes and snow boots I wore during the murder

670
37:48.920 --> 37:50.960
are right in the old plant's basement.

671
37:51.519 --> 37:52.880
Take the police there to get them,

672
37:53.199 --> 37:54.920
and you'll see I'm telling the truth.

673
37:55.079 --> 37:56.920
Tieping, don't talk nonsense!

674
37:58.639 --> 38:00.360
I dumped Ma Guowen's body!

675
38:01.039 --> 38:02.440
I put it on the train tracks!

676
38:02.679 --> 38:03.960
I'm guilty! I'm guilty!

677
38:03.960 --> 38:04.440
Master...

678
38:04.639 --> 38:05.639
Tieping made a mistake,

679
38:06.519 --> 38:08.519
and I covered for him!

680
38:08.639 --> 38:09.199
No!

681
38:10.039 --> 38:11.119
I was wrong.

682
38:11.119 --> 38:12.199
It's all my fault.

683
38:12.639 --> 38:13.519
Tieping.

684
38:15.840 --> 38:16.360
Tieping.

685
38:17.159 --> 38:17.760
Tieping...

686
38:20.119 --> 38:21.039
Come back with me.

687
38:21.039 --> 38:22.199
Let's turn ourselves in.

688
38:22.599 --> 38:23.280
Master...

689
38:24.400 --> 38:25.519
It's too late.

690
38:33.559 --> 38:36.679
I never should've gone looking for Ma Guowen!

691
38:38.960 --> 38:40.239
The moment I saw he was dead,

692
38:40.239 --> 38:42.000
I knew what happened.

693
38:42.880 --> 38:45.119
I kept shielding you, kept protecting you...

694
38:45.440 --> 38:46.559
I was just terrified something would happen to you.

695
38:46.679 --> 38:48.840
Terrified you'd get hurt!

696
38:51.760 --> 38:53.159
I was a fool! Such a fool!

697
38:53.159 --> 38:54.559
I was a fool, Master!

698
38:56.239 --> 38:56.840
Master...

699
38:57.599 --> 38:58.320
Don't cry.

700
38:59.199 --> 39:00.119
I killed people.

701
39:00.320 --> 39:01.199
I committed crimes.

702
39:01.440 --> 39:02.000
I own up to it.

703
39:05.840 --> 39:06.800
Shen Leshui.

704
39:07.039 --> 39:08.320
You say you didn't take that money.

705
39:08.599 --> 39:09.880
Then go uncover the truth.

706
39:09.960 --> 39:12.239
I'll definitely track down where that money went,

707
39:13.000 --> 39:14.519
and bring justice to Liu Xuemei.

708
39:16.119 --> 39:16.840
Xiaosheng.

709
39:20.039 --> 39:21.320
You have to believe this:

710
39:22.360 --> 39:23.400
your mother was a good person.

711
39:23.639 --> 39:24.280
I believe it.

712
39:25.440 --> 39:26.000
I believe you.

713
39:43.840 --> 39:44.719
Tieping.

714
39:45.679 --> 39:46.679
You're right.

715
39:48.679 --> 39:49.400
We have to accept it.

716
39:51.639 --> 39:52.159
Come on.

717
40:09.000 --> 40:10.039
Put your hands up!

718
40:26.599 --> 40:26.960
Cuff him!

719
40:26.960 --> 40:27.760
Freeze! Don't move!

720
40:29.840 --> 40:30.320
Don't move!

721
40:30.800 --> 40:31.280
Stay down!

722
41:44.119 --> 41:45.119
Sister Xuemei,

723
41:46.320 --> 41:47.280
I promise you,

724
41:48.880 --> 41:50.639
I'll find out where this money went

725
41:51.639 --> 41:52.840
and clear your name.

726
42:06.519 --> 42:07.719
Your old classmate said

727
42:08.280 --> 42:10.199
she has to track down this money,

728
42:10.360 --> 42:11.840
or she won't leave Lacheng.

729
42:12.000 --> 42:12.599
Where's your bag?

730
42:12.920 --> 42:13.880
Where's the bag? Don't touch me!

731
42:14.039 --> 42:14.639
Where's the bag?

732
42:15.360 --> 42:16.280
Where did you hide the money?

733
42:16.440 --> 42:17.639
When you picked up that bag,

734
42:17.639 --> 42:18.760
was the bag empty?

735
42:20.079 --> 42:21.840
If there was anything in it, would they toss it?

736
42:22.079 --> 42:23.599
You took Liu Xuemei's money.
